@L 2026_06_13_7b_recalibration := "RECALIBRATION (③ recipe-check) — h1141 7B is loose-grammar ENGLISH not byte-garble; recipe is 303M-validated (H_1129); 7B closer to a7b_pass than 'word-salad' implied" :: log [active]
  evidence = "compared actual generated text. h1141 7B G0: 'The eventual million ended do not the enclosure of an individual film' (loose-grammar real-word English). H_1129 303M (the accepted 🟢 EMERGENCE): 'The eventual minds of the city was included at the are related mentioned' (SAME loose-grammar register). The OLD broad-7b H_1128 (true garble): '높이 consciousness expergence를 수합니다' (Korean-script collapse). h1141 is the MIDDLE one — NOT byte-garble."
