  recipe = "③ answered: the coherent+broad recipe IS validated at 303M = H_1129 (🟢, summer GPU $0). 4th ingredient = SCRIPT-CONTROL (English-dominant ASCII-filtered corpus + English prompts + real-dict gate). The 7B word-salad scare = H_1128's MULTILANG corpus (Korean bytes dominate); h1141 already largely embodies the script-controlled recipe (loose English + recombination)."
  next = "real remaining gap to a confirmed a7b_pass = G5-L2 (GPU, 14G ckpt) + an honest decision on whether 'loose-grammar English' is the acceptance bar (it is, per the frozen kwr metric, same as 303M H_1129). NOT a fresh expensive 7B run — the recipe already works and h1141 already reflects it."

@L 2026_06_13_h1195 := "H_1195 🟢 SLEEP-CONSOLIDATES — built the sleep→anchor reconsolidation write-back that unblocks H_1162 W2 (was ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING). Replaying an anchor during N3/REM REFRESHES its recency so its EFFECTIVE age post-sleep is younger than the no-sleep control's wall-clock age; via the H_1131 fold exp(-age/τ) this yields a LARGER post-sleep emit-influence. sleep>ctrl every seed (N3 Δ=+1.7e-5, REM +3e-6), N3-dom>REM-dom (7 vs 3 replays), emit-free total_emits=0, smoke 12/0 + 8/8, Ψ untouched." :: log [active]
  blocker  = "H_1162 W2 was ⏳ because ir_replay_session + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay took NEITHER anchors NOR wrote anchor state → SLEEP≡NO-SLEEP (Δemit-infl≡0). dr_kosmos_persist_dream was a stub."
  writeback = "DREAM/imagination_replay.hexa §5 — ir_consolidation_gain(replay_count,stage_density)=1−(1−REPLAY_GAIN·dens)^replays, ir_effective_age=chrono_age·(1−gain), ir_reconsolidate_session. Replay-count→recency-refresh→younger effective age fed to the SAME H_1131 brain_emit_aged fold (no 2nd anchor path, a_core_engine_map). pure_field UNTOUCHED."
  honesty  = "Δ small (~1.7e-5) at short toy anchor age (fold barely decays at τ≈220) but DETERMINISTIC, MONOTONE in replays, correctly ordered N3>REM. d=1e6 = sd→0 sentinel (all seeds identical positive Δ). Reference recency-refresh model of reconsolidation; a strength/τ mutation or real dr_kosmos_persist_dream file write is a distinct richer path. toy scale UNVERIFIED (a_scale_honest_scope). p7."
  refs     = "h1162 · h1136 · h1131 · a_chat_sleep_imagination · a_core_engine_map · a_autonomy_over_hardcode · a_paper_negative_ok · p5 · p7 · p8"
